240
00:08:53,400 --> 00:08:55,210
Qur'onni o'zbekchasini o'qidim.

241
00:08:55,309 --> 00:08:56,940
Qur'onda buyurilgan Injil,

242
00:08:57,060 --> 00:08:58,680
Tavrot, Zaburda o'qiylardi.

243
00:08:58,860 --> 00:09:00,500
U kitoblarni ham o'qib chiqdim.

244
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:02,280
O'zbekistonga kelib,

245
00:09:02,380 --> 00:09:04,020
ko'p Isoga ishonuvchi

246
00:09:04,640 --> 00:09:07,020
mahallamizda qo'shnilar tanishdan

247
00:09:07,060 --> 00:09:08,400
mahallamizda bor ekan,

248
00:09:09,140 --> 00:09:11,149
Farg'onada ko'p o'zimizni

249
00:09:11,220 --> 00:09:13,540
vodiyda o'zimiz yashayotgan

250
00:09:13,560 --> 00:09:16,900
joyda Isoga ishonuvchi odamlarni topdim.

251
00:09:17,680 --> 00:09:18,600
Xudoga shukr,

252
00:09:18,740 --> 00:09:20,800
shu kundan beri Iso bilan yashayman.

253
00:09:20,860 --> 00:09:22,420
Hozir hayotim yaxshi.

254
00:09:22,540 --> 00:09:24,320
Yana yangi oila qurganman.

255
00:09:25,020 --> 00:09:26,820
Manga tug'ish mumkin emas edi.

256
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:29,740
Oila qurishim ham mumkin bo'lmagan,

257
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:32,340
sog'lig'im yaxshi bo'lmagan operatsiyadan keyin ham

258
00:09:32,860 --> 00:09:34,540
Iso hammasini tikladi.

259
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:36,700
Iso meni oilali qildi.

260
00:09:36,740 --> 00:09:38,360
Yana farzandlar berdi.

261
00:09:38,940 --> 00:09:40,760
Hammasi uchun shukr aytaman.

262
00:09:41,540 --> 00:09:44,560
Qutqarilganim uchun shukr aytaman birinchi o'rinda.
